,"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"Share this tip"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"Hide details"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Cost"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Compared with buying online, you pay for consultations and follow-ups and visit a clinic periodically. The hard part is attending follow-ups throughout treatment, often one or two years."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Benefit"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["The Center for Medical Device Evaluation of China’s National Medical Products Administration stated in its 2022 registration-review guidance for bracket-free orthodontic appliances that these aligners are Class II devices. Instructions must state that they should be worn under the guidance of a physician with professional orthodontic qualifications during treatment, and include requirements for eating, toothbrushing, and regular follow-ups. Product names are advised not to include vague or hypothetical concepts such as “invisible.” The US Food and Drug Administration (FDA) says it has not authorized clear aligners sold directly to consumers without a prescription and supervision by a dentist or orthodontist. It also says an in-person examination can help reduce the risks of uneven bite, unintended tooth movement, pain, and tooth loss. Regular in-person follow-ups after starting aligners help confirm that teeth are moving safely as planned. Both sources are regulatory documents and give no incidence figures."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Original sources"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["国家药品监督管理局医疗器械技术审评中心 (2022). 无托槽矫治器注册审查指导原则（2022 年第 41 号）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.cmde.org.cn/flfg/zdyz/zdyzwbk/20230103095116100.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.cmde.org.cn/flfg/zdyz/zdyzwbk/20230103095116100.html"]},"；国家卫生健康委办公厅等 (2023). 关于进一步推进口腔医疗服务和保障管理工作的通知（国卫办医政发〔2023〕11 号，第五条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202309/content_6903786.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202309/content_6903786.htm"]},"；U.S. Food and Drug Administration (2026). Clear Dental Aligners（页面 2026 年 9 月 9 日更新）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.fda.gov/medical-devices/dental-devices/clear-dental-aligners","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.fda.gov/medical-devices/dental-devices/clear-dental-aligners"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.cmde.org.cn/flfg/zdyz/zdyzwbk/20230103095116100.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["Open source link"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24